      <p>The Node Observability Operator is not installed in OpenShift Container Platform by default. You can install the Node Observability Operator by using the OpenShift Container Platform CLI or the web console.</p>
      <h3 id="install-node-observability-using-cli_node-observability-operator" class="group scroll-mt-20">Installing the Node Observability Operator using the CLI<a href="#install-node-observability-using-cli_node-observability-operator" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
